  "description": "Framework-agnostic vector-storage contracts for RAG pipelines and custom database adapters. Defines IVectorStore, records, search results, metadata filters, batch retrieval, counts and connection verification. Optional ITextSearchStore and IConfigurableHybridSearchStore support text-only and explicitly configured hybrid queries. HybridSearchOptions and shared fusion helpers provide validated, normalized weighted RRF with top-K and score thresholds; existing vector-store contracts remain available. What's New in v4.1.0: Optional text and configurable hybrid search contracts with validated weighted RRF.",
