  "releaseNotes": "v4.1.0: Adds optional ITextSearchStore and IConfigurableHybridSearchStore capabilities, validated HybridSearchOptions and shared normalized weighted-RRF fusion with final top-K and score thresholds. Existing IVectorStore implementations and direct hybrid calls remain available. Native keyword/vector scores remain distinct from weighted-RRF scores. Full notes: https://github.com/AJ-comp/Mythosia.AI/blob/main/src/vectordb/Mythosia.VectorDb.Abstractions/RELEASE_NOTES.md#v410",
